      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purcell%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Federal Courthouse for Indian Territory at the east end of Main Street is a landmark site of the former court of jurisdiction.",
